#: services/guides.py:99
msgid "llms.txt: guida pratica per la citabilità IA"
msgstr "llms.txt: praktische Anleitung zur AI-Zitierbarkeit"

#: services/guides.py:101
msgid ""
"Cos’è llms.txt, come strutturarlo per AIO/GEO e come Centropic lo genera e lo"
" valida nel crawl."
msgstr ""
"Was ist llms.txt, wie man es für AIO/GEO strukturiert und wie Centropic es "
"generiert und im Crawl validiert."

#: services/guides.py:104
msgid ""
"Un file root machine-readable che spiega brand, topic e pagine preferite ai "
"modelli e crawler AI."
msgstr ""
"Eine maschinenlesbare Root-Datei, die Marke, Thema und bevorzugte Seiten für "
"AI-Modelle und Crawler erklärt."

#: services/guides.py:107
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Perché conta</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">llms.txt riduce ambiguità entity: dice chi sei, cosa "
"offri e quali URL citare. In Centropic la presenza e la qualità del file "
"alimentano score AIO/GEO (probe Misurato).</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Answer engine e crawler AI (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, "
"PerplexityBot, Google-Extended) usano segnali pubblici; un llms.txt chiaro è "
"un’ancora di citazione accanto a Schema.org e robots permissivi.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Sezioni utili</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Site / Summary / Key topics con brand e dominio canonici</li>\n"
"      <li>Preferred citation (brand + acronimi espansi: AIO, GEO)</li>\n"
"      <li>Important pages con URL https assoluti</li>\n"
"      <li>Disambiguazione (cosa non siete: GIS, All-in-One generici)</li>\n"
"      <li>Contact e owner / parent organization</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Come Centropic aiuta</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Ogni analisi genera una bozza <code>llms.txt</code> nel"
" pack HTML unico. Pubblicala in root "
"(<code>https://tuodominio/llms.txt</code>) e ri-analizza: il finding passa a "
"“disponibile” se il probe la trova.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Esempio vivo: il llms.txt di Centropic è su <a "
"href=\"/llms.txt\">centropic.ai/llms.txt</a>, con preferred citation e link a"
" metodologia.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Checklist rapida</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Una sola brand primaria (evita nomi fantasma)</li>\n"
"      <li>URL canonici https, niente query di tracking</li>\n"
"      <li>Allinea llms.txt a JSON-LD Organization e alla home</li>\n"
"      <li>Aggiorna la data quando cambi offerta o positioning</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Vedi anche <a href=\"/guide/schema-ai\">Schema AI</a> e"
" <a href=\"/metodologia\">metodologia</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Warum es wichtig ist</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">llms.txt reduziert Entity-Mehrdeutigkeit: es sagt, wer "
"du bist, was du anbietest und welche URLs zitiert werden sollen. Bei "
"Centropic fließen Vorhandensein und Qualität der Datei in die AIO/GEO-Scores "
"ein (Measured-Probe).</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Answer Engines und KI-Crawler (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, "
"PerplexityBot, Google-Extended) nutzen öffentliche Signale; eine klare "
"llms.txt ist ein Zitat-Anker neben Schema.org und einer freigebenden "
"robots.txt.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Nützliche Abschnitte</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Site / Summary / Key Topics mit kanonischer Marke und Domain</li>\n"
"      <li>Preferred Citation (Marke + ausgeschriebene Akronyme: AIO, "
"GEO)</li>\n"
"      <li>Important Pages mit absoluten https-URLs</li>\n"
"      <li>Disambiguation (was ihr nicht seid: GIS, generisches All-in-"
"One)</li>\n"
"      <li>Contact und Owner / übergeordnete Organisation</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Wie Centropic hilft</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Jede Analyse erzeugt einen Entwurf für "
"<code>llms.txt</code> im einzelnen HTML-Pack. Veröffentliche ihn im Root "
"(<code>https://deinedomain/llms.txt</code>) und analysiere erneut: das "
"Finding wird zu „verfügbar“, sobald die Probe ihn findet.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Live-Beispiel: Centropics eigene llms.txt liegt unter "
"<a href=\"/llms.txt\">centropic.ai/llms.txt</a>, mit Preferred Citation und "
"Link zur Methodik.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Schnelle Checkliste</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Eine einzige primäre Marke (vermeide Fantasienamen)</li>\n"
"      <li>Kanonische https-URLs, keine Tracking-Parameter</li>\n"
"      <li>llms.txt mit JSON-LD Organization und der Startseite abstimmen</li>"
"\n"
"      <li>Datum aktualisieren, wenn sich Angebot oder Positionierung "
"ändert</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Siehe auch <a href=\"/guide/schema-ai\">Schema AI</a> "
"und die <a href=\"/metodologia\">Methodik</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"

#: services/guides.py:147
msgid "Schema.org per answer engine (AIO/GEO)"
msgstr "Schema.org für Antwortmaschinen (AIO/GEO)"

#: services/guides.py:149
msgid ""
"Quali tipi Schema.org aiutano AI-Driven Visibility e Generative Engine "
"Optimization: Organization, WebSite, FAQPage, SoftwareApplication, Article."
msgstr ""
"Welche Schema.org-Typen helfen bei AI-Driven Visibility und Generative Engine"
" Optimization: Organisation, Webseite, FAQ-Seite, Softwareanwendung, Artikel."

#: services/guides.py:152
msgid ""
"I dati strutturati non “garantiscono” citazioni, ma rendono l’entity "
"leggibile a crawler e modelli. Aggiornato 30/07/2026."
msgstr ""
"Strukturierte Daten „garantieren“ keine Zitationen, machen die Entity jedoch "
"für Crawler und Modelle lesbar. Aktualisiert am 30.07.2026."

#: services/guides.py:155
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Tipi prioritari</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li><strong>Organization</strong> + <strong>WebSite</strong> collegati "
"via @id</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>FAQPage</strong> per Q&amp;A tipizzate allineate all’HTML "
"visibile</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>SoftwareApplication</strong> o Product se vendi software "
"(come Centropic)</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>Article</strong> / HowTo per guide evergreen con author e "
"date</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Riferimento normativo: <a href=\"https://schema.org/\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">schema.org</a>. In Centropic i "
"tipi rilevati alimentano score AIO/GEO (probe Misurato).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Errori comuni</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">JSON-LD orfano senza tipi chiave, sameAs solo self-"
"referenziali, FAQ senza acceptedAnswer, Organization senza contatto o logo. "
"Centropic li segnala nei findings.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Un sameAs verso il solo sito proprietario non basta: "
"preferisci profili esterni reali (azienda madre, directory, social "
"verificati).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Checklist minima</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>name + url + email (o telephone) su Organization</li>\n"
"      <li>sameAs verso profili esterni reali (non pagine interne del "
"sito)</li>\n"
"      <li>logo ImageObject con URL assoluto https e caption</li>\n"
"      <li>FAQPage solo se le domande sono visibili in pagina</li>\n"
"      <li>knowsAbout allineato a llms.txt e al copy della home</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Vedi anche <a href=\"/metodologia\">metodologia</a>, <a"
" href=\"/guide/llms-txt\">llms.txt</a> e <a href=\"/guide/score-vs-"
"sov\">score vs SoV</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"<section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Prioritäre Typen</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li><strong>Organisation</strong> + <strong>Webseite</strong> verbunden"
" über @id</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>FAQPage</strong> für typisierte Q&amp;A, die mit dem "
"sichtbaren HTML übereinstimmen</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>Softwareanwendung</strong> oder Produkt, wenn du Software "
"verkaufst (wie Centropic)</li>\n"
"      <li><strong>Artikel</strong> / HowTo für Evergreen-Guides mit Autor und"
" Datum</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Normative Referenz: <a href=\"https://schema.org/\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">schema.org</a>. In Centropic "
"speisen die erkannten Typen die AIO/GEO-Scores (Probe Gemessen).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Häufige Fehler</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">JSON-LD verwaist ohne Schlüsseltypen, sameAs nur "
"selbstreferenziell, FAQ ohne acceptedAnswer, Organisation ohne Kontakt oder "
"Logo. Centropic weist sie in den Ergebnissen aus.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Ein sameAs nur zur eigenen Website reicht nicht aus: "
"bevorzuge echte externe Profile (Muttergesellschaft, Verzeichnisse, "
"verifizierte soziale Medien).</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Minimale Checkliste</h2>\n"
"    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n"
"      <li>Name + URL + E-Mail (oder Telefon) bei Organisation</li>\n"
"      <li>sameAs zu echten externen Profilen (nicht interne Seiten der "
"Website)</li>\n"
"      <li>Logo ImageObject mit absoluter https-URL und Bildunterschrift</li>\n"
"      <li>FAQPage nur, wenn die Fragen auf der Seite sichtbar sind</li>\n"
"      <li>knowsAbout abgestimmt auf llms.txt und den Text der Startseite</li>"
"\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Siehe auch <a href=\"/metodologia\">Methodik</a>, <a "
"href=\"/guide/llms-txt\">llms.txt</a> und <a href=\"/guide/score-vs-"
"sov\">Score vs SoV</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>"

#: services/guides.py:191
msgid "CVI, score AIO/GEO e citation share"
msgstr "AIO/GEO-Score und SoV"

#: services/guides.py:193
msgid ""
"Centropic Visibility Index (CVI) vs sotto-score AIO/GEO e citation share "
"campionata (SoV proxy/measured)."
msgstr ""
"Centropic Visibility Index (CVI) vs. AIO/GEO-Subscores und "
"stichprobenbasierte Citation Share (SoV proxy/measured)."

#: services/guides.py:196
msgid ""
"Tre livelli: CVI (standard proprietario), AIO/GEO (componenti), citation "
"share (campione stocastico sulle risposte)."
msgstr ""
"Drei Ebenen: CVI (proprietärer Standard), AIO/GEO (Komponenten), Citation "
"Share (stochastische Stichprobe von Antworten)."

#: services/guides.py:199
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Centropic Visibility Index (CVI)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Il <strong>CVI</strong> è la metrica di categoria di "
"Centropic: 0–100 + lettera DDD→AAA. Riassume predisposizione strutturale "
"(AIO+GEO) con penalità findings. È ciò che confronti tra brand, competitor e "
"nel tempo.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Score AIO / GEO (componenti)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Sotto-score 0–100 da crawl e probe. Badge Stimato sul "
"compositario; i check di presenza file possono essere Misurato.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>AIO (AI-Driven Visibility)</strong> premia "
"leggibilità per sistemi IA: entity, schema, FAQ, llms.txt, meta. <strong>GEO "
"(Generative Engine Optimization)</strong> premia citabilità e policy crawler "
"AI.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Citation share (non SoV "
"pubblicitaria)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Nei media tradizionali “Share of Voice” conta "
"impression e PR. Qui misuriamo <strong>menzioni in risposte "
"generative</strong> — stocastiche, prompt-dipendenti. In UI resta l’etichetta"
" SoV per continuità; in metodologia è citation share.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Proxy</strong>: formula su AIO/GEO + robots. "
"<strong>Measured</strong> (Plus/Business): campioni prompt su LLM con "
"conteggio menzioni brand. Non confondere i due.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Come leggerli insieme</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Alza il <strong>CVI</strong> chiudendo i gap AIO/GEO: "
"l’IA non cita ciò che non legge. Poi campiona la citation share. CVI alto = "
"controllo del dato; measured = campione sulle risposte.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Centropic mostra sempre l’evidence badge: Stimato, "
"Misto o Misurato. Dettagli in <a href=\"/metodologia\">metodologia</a> e nel "
"prodotto su <a href=\"/prodotto\">/prodotto</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Score AIO / GEO</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Indizes 0–100 aus Crawl und Probes. Estimated-Badge auf"
" dem Composite; einzelne Datei-Präsenzchecks können Measured sein.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>AIO (AI-Driven Visibility)</strong> belohnt "
"Lesbarkeit für KI-Systeme: Entity, Schema, FAQ, llms.txt, Meta. <strong>GEO "
"(Generative Engine Optimization)</strong> belohnt Zitierbarkeit und KI-"
"Crawler-Policy.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Share of Voice (SoV)</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Proxy</strong>: eine Formel auf AIO/GEO + "
"beobachteter robots.txt. <strong>Measured</strong>: Prompt-Polling auf LLMs "
"(Plus/Business) mit Zählung der Markenerwähnungen. Beide nicht "
"verwechseln.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Um SoV measured zu erhöhen: öffentliche Entity stärken "
"(llms.txt, Organization, about), zitierbare Inhalte veröffentlichen und die "
"Prompt Bank mit Fragen erweitern, die dein Markt tatsächlich stellt.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"  <section class=\"page-section\">\n"
"    <h2 class=\"page-section__title\">Wie man sie gemeinsam liest</h2>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Zuerst die Signale erhöhen (Score), dann die Stimme "
"messen (SoV). Eine hohe SoV mit niedrigem Score ist fragil; ein hoher Score "
"ohne SoV measured bleibt eine Diagnose, kein Zitat-Nachweis.</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"lede\">Centropic zeigt immer das Evidence-Badge: Estimated, "
"Mixed oder Measured. Details in der <a href=\"/metodologia\">Methodik</a> und"
" im Produkt unter <a href=\"/prodotto\">/prodotto</a>.</p>\n"
"  </section>\n"

